  "_doc": "Figma variable <-> code token. Code is canonical for VALUES; this map records only the correspondence. Filled by hand from a live read, by whoever is doing the work — there is no skill that sweeps the file, because a scheduled sweep would imply an authority the design canvas does not have. See ../README.md. A variable with `code: null` is drift — Figma has a variable with no token behind it. KEYS ARE `<collection>/<variable name>`, not the bare variable name: this file has the same name in several collections (`16` is in Spacing, Size, Font size and Line height), so the bare name is not unique. `variableId` is omitted: it is file-local and ephemeral, and nothing joins on it.",
